{%- comment -%}
  Fyxx: Rewards band (product block)
  Replaces the old loyalty "member price" line, which stated a false checkout
  discount. This shows the points the bottle earns, the only figure that comes
  straight from the LoyaltyLion earn rule.

  Earn rule: points = (variant price in JD) x (tier rate).
  Tier rates: Blue 3, Silver 4, Gold 5, Platinum 5.
  Price is read the same way as the old snippet: variant.price is in fils, so
  divide by 100.

  Signed out: #f7f7fa band, calculated points at the Blue rate, a line about
  what points buy, and Sign in / Create an account pills (each carrying
  ?return_url back to the product).
  Signed in: same logo and points line at the member's tier rate, the tier name,
  and the tier gradient background. No sign in buttons. A signed-in member with
  no tier value is treated as Blue and kept on the #f7f7fa band, not a gradient.

  Exclusion: LoyaltyLion zeroes the rate for anything in the collection
  "ll-fyxx-rewards-exclude". On those products this renders nothing at all.

  No JavaScript: the points figure reflects the first/selected variant at page
  load and does not recalculate when the variant changes (same limit as the old
  snippet). No font-family is declared.

  LOGO: the Fyxx Rewards mark is inlined below from the brand's SVG (Shopify
  Files), stripped of its Illustrator style block, clip paths and class
  attributes. It carries fill="currentColor", so it follows the band's text
  colour rather than needing two files: black on Blue, Gold, Silver and the
  plain signed-out band, white on Platinum. 56px wide (lockup ~1.9 to 1).

  Silver gradient: deliberately lightened from the brand file's sampled values
  (#717275 to #b3b4b5) to #9a9b9d to #cfd0d1, so ink text passes contrast across
  the whole band. White text failed on the light stop and ink failed on the
  dark stop of the original, so neither worked on the sampled gradient.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign excluded = false
  for c in product.collections
    if c.handle == 'll-fyxx-rewards-exclude'
      assign excluded = true
      break
    endif
  endfor
-%}

{%- unless excluded -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign price_jd = product.selected_or_first_available_variant.price | divided_by: 100.0

    assign tier = ''
    if customer
      assign tier = customer.metafields.loyaltylion.loyalty_tier
    endif

    assign rate = 3
    case tier
      when 'Silver'
        assign rate = 4
      when 'Gold'
        assign rate = 5
      when 'Platinum'
        assign rate = 5
    endcase

    assign points = price_jd | times: rate | round: 0

    assign variant = 'plain'
    if customer and tier != blank
      case tier
        when 'Blue'
          assign variant = 'blue'
        when 'Silver'
          assign variant = 'silver'
        when 'Gold'
          assign variant = 'gold'
        when 'Platinum'
          assign variant = 'platinum'
      endcase
    endif
  -%}

  <div class="fx-rewards fx-rewards--{{ variant }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
